v 3
d exactnl: Exact likelihood correction for nested logit share-form estimation
d
d Authors: Lisa M. George and Matthew J. Baker
d
d exactnl implements the likelihood correction for the Berry share-form
d nested logit estimator with variable choice sets.
d
d If you use this command, please cite:
d Baker, Matthew J. and Lisa M. George. Demand Estimation with Variable Choice Sets:
d A Likelihood Correction for BLP Models. Working paper.
d
f exactnl.ado
f exactnl.sthlp
f exactnl_example.do
f exactnl_certification.do
